soon as possible to discuss.<o:p></o:p></span></p><div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you,&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div><font face="arial">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Title}</span></div><div><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</font></div></div><div><font face="arial">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div><span style="font-family: arial;">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</span></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
